teachers-student-2015-03-04#:~:text=And%20just%20like%20that%20she%20was%20trapped.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Great Teacher's Student\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Mar 2015."}},{"id":"great-teachers-student-2015-03-04-e6","era":null,"summary":"After a year of worsening restlessness, Narset descends the mountain and finds an ancient forbidden archive beneath Dragon's Eye.","participants":["narset","dragon-s-eye-sanctuary"],"location":"dragon-s-eye-sanctuary","importance":"major","page":"stories/great-teachers-student-2015-03-04","order":488,"story_date":"2015-03-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":128,"quote":"It had to be an ancient archive, a place that she had only heard of in legend, a place that Ojutai had all but forbidden.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/great-teachers-student-2015-03-04#:~:text=It%20had%20to%20be,had%20all%20but%20forbidden.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Great Teacher's Student","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-03-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/great-teachers-student-2015-03-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/great-teachers-student-2015-03-04#:~:text=It%20had%20to%20be,had%20all%20but%20forbidden.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Great Teacher's Student\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Mar 2015."}},{"id":"great-teachers-student-2015-03-04-e7","era":null,"summary":"The scrolls contradict Ojutai's teaching by speaking of khans and dragons before him.","participants":["narset","ojutai"],"location":"dragon-s-eye-sanctuary","importance":"major","page":"stories/great-teachers-student-2015-03-04","order":488,"story_date":"2015-03-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":130,"quote":"And from what the scrolls said, it seemed that there had been dragons before Oju